# Infrastructure

## docker-compose.yml

- Full stack definition lives in `docs/01-docker.md` Task 4 when empty
- Kafka listeners: host `localhost:9092`, internal `kafka:29092`
- Mount `./dags` and `./producer` into Airflow

## Airflow DAGs (`dags/`)

- One DAG per file; unique `dag_id`
- `catchup=False` for this project
- `news_fetch_dag`: schedule `*/10 * * * *`, runs producer
- See `docs/03-airflow.md`

## Scripts (`scripts/`)

- Bash with `set -euo pipefail`
- Run from repo root via `scripts/*.sh`
- Do not embed secrets in scripts

Verify: `./scripts/health_check.sh` after `docker compose up -d`.
